   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Contribution to the International Monetary Fund for the purpose of CCRT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det, som &#xe4;r en del av en samlad internationell anstr&#xe4;ngning, bed&#xf6;ms ha goda f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar att frig&#xf6;ra resurser i l&#xe5;ginkomstl&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r att hantera effekterna av det nya coronaviruset (Covid-19)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support, which is part of an overall international contribution, is considered to have good possibilities for liberate capital resources in low-income countries to deal with the effects of the new corona virus (Covid-19).</narrative>
